{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FUEL YOUR SCIENTIFIC CURIOSITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster Lab Simulator</strong> delivers the thrill of synthesis and tactical battle. Every experiment is a surprise, and every recipe is a chance to discover something legendary. Are you ready to manage the world's most advanced monster lab?<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/e5f23a5dfeaf983ee0dcf33ad068f074.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/e5f23a5dfeaf983ee0dcf33ad068f074.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/e5f23a5dfeaf983ee0dcf33ad068f074.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase mysterious essences, synthesize eggs, and complete their growth in the incubator to bring unique Fulus to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ada4b4112b931a575835c8f22f66bd0e.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ada4b4112b931a575835c8f22f66bd0e.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ada4b4112b931a575835c8f22f66bd0e.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden recipes by combining various essences. Obtain surprise Fulus and expand your ultimate collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ff0c66a7d7eca332a2910c2dcda154ad.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ff0c66a7d7eca332a2910c2dcda154ad.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ff0c66a7d7eca332a2910c2dcda154ad.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary Fulu Battles are about to begin. Prepare your squad and take your place in the war room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/882046a338ae4d21dd54461544fdcba4.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/882046a338ae4d21dd54461544fdcba4.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/882046a338ae4d21dd54461544fdcba4.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture your Fulus with orbs and add them to your collection. These orbs will form your elite battle army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/2a320c808ab9ec16d55fd51b3d94e351.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/2a320c808ab9ec16d55fd51b3d94e351.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/2a320c808ab9ec16d55fd51b3d94e351.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your orbed Fulus and reinvest to acquire new high-tech products. Expand your lab, accelerate production, and obtain even more powerful Fulus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/581330cb236f8f8041fd299f5d8b4786.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/581330cb236f8f8041fd299f5d8b4786.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/581330cb236f8f8041fd299f5d8b4786.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge three Fulus using the evolution machine. Unlock stronger abilities, higher essence yields, and brand-new tactical combat options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/228305aa366e24ea6ecd9e0b9c3c3fa0.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/228305aa366e24ea6ecd9e0b9c3c3fa0.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/228305aa366e24ea6ecd9e0b9c3c3fa0.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep mischievous Fulus out of trouble, watch over them when they get naughty, and ensure your lab is always a happy, healthy environment for your creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/89e8b45d320f3ce65aa78b586e85f5d5.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/89e8b45d320f3ce65aa78b586e85f5d5.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/89e8b45d320f3ce65aa78b586e85f5d5.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How lucky are you? Spin the lucky lever and win surprises to power up your Fulus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/5291d562f8f328a5629a4db1571abc4a.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/5291d562f8f328a5629a4db1571abc4a.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/5291d562f8f328a5629a4db1571abc4a.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain special eggs from ancient ambers. Melt the ambers and reveal the eggs hidden within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/939e730ca029e09de664178af2174c4d.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/939e730ca029e09de664178af2174c4d.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/939e730ca029e09de664178af2174c4d.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulus exhausted from battle regenerate in habitats matching their elements. Keep them happy by placing them in the correct elemental zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster Lab Simulator</strong> combines the thrill of synthesis and combat with the joy of collecting and the magic of discovering the unknown\u2014all within your very own monster laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 Unique Fulu Families</strong> \u2013 Discover 20 different Fulu lineages in your lab!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abilities &amp; Elements</strong> \u2013 80 distinct abilities tailored to specific Fulu families and elements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Order Management</strong> \u2013 Monitor the order screen and boost your economy by meeting market demands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Areas to Explore</strong> \u2013 Level up to unlock deep sections of the laboratory. Upgrade your facility, enhance machinery, and maintain hygiene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assistant Trash Robot</strong> \u2013 End the lab clutter; add the stylish and hardworking trash robot to your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily &amp; Weekly Missions</strong> \u2013 New laboratory tasks await you every single day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finally; A Pair of Eyes\u2026</strong> \u2013 Beware of the eyes that are constantly watching you in the lab.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Nerimpossible!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994610/dac1a60ac65630529f3508b2ecea63de886947c1.jpg"},{"name":"Fulumetal Alchemist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994610/9fbd37b038ea6a9f4f0a062457b34a980f3a13aa.jpg"},{"name":"Who let the Fulus out?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994610/554e52c2f93507dcdedb4ade8c5b5e388c365fd6.jpg"},{"name":"My Precious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994610/3bed09454ab48eda075250a5f5f146a3bf8c5478.jpg"},{"name":"Invincible!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994610/27d93b8c348b2b796efaca6f7f128be4656a17cc.jpg"},{"name":"Avengers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994610/ae3bf9957b16629f5051cea9527f09ba774a5818.jpg"},{"name":"Master of All Recipes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994610/dc61502899ca69037ce038d60ab49688944b0070.jpg"},{"name":"Is that Evolution?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994610/b88b491ac4ee66cdf79ebc643bd59e295cdb5c72.jpg"},{"name":"Pure Elements","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994610/e8f07d39892f3d5c9f255c135bffd6ef4f3c7168.jpg"},{"name":"Fulush Royal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3994610/81563ef9717290561442ae6fb3c7d7fb3a79ad97.jpg"}],"total":23},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994610?t=1774821803","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3994610?t=1774821803","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/770cc62f535d8aad2314f85507421385b5d50197/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774821803","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/770cc62f535d8aad2314f85507421385b5d50197/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774821803","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap to Our Dreams</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/aede43e4f20bb017d838006ba2afd9f9.avif?t=1774821803\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras_big/aede43e4f20bb017d838006ba2afd9f9.webp?t=1774821803 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FUEL YOUR SCIENTIFIC CURIOSITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster Lab Simulator</strong> delivers the thrill of synthesis and tactical battle. Every experiment is a surprise, and every recipe is a chance to discover something legendary. Are you ready to manage the world's most advanced monster lab?<br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/e5f23a5dfeaf983ee0dcf33ad068f074.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/e5f23a5dfeaf983ee0dcf33ad068f074.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/e5f23a5dfeaf983ee0dcf33ad068f074.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase mysterious essences, synthesize eggs, and complete their growth in the incubator to bring unique Fulus to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ada4b4112b931a575835c8f22f66bd0e.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ada4b4112b931a575835c8f22f66bd0e.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ada4b4112b931a575835c8f22f66bd0e.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden recipes by combining various essences. Obtain surprise Fulus and expand your ultimate collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ff0c66a7d7eca332a2910c2dcda154ad.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ff0c66a7d7eca332a2910c2dcda154ad.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/ff0c66a7d7eca332a2910c2dcda154ad.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary Fulu Battles are about to begin. Prepare your squad and take your place in the war room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/882046a338ae4d21dd54461544fdcba4.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/882046a338ae4d21dd54461544fdcba4.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/882046a338ae4d21dd54461544fdcba4.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture your Fulus with orbs and add them to your collection. These orbs will form your elite battle army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/2a320c808ab9ec16d55fd51b3d94e351.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/2a320c808ab9ec16d55fd51b3d94e351.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/2a320c808ab9ec16d55fd51b3d94e351.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your orbed Fulus and reinvest to acquire new high-tech products. Expand your lab, accelerate production, and obtain even more powerful Fulus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/581330cb236f8f8041fd299f5d8b4786.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/581330cb236f8f8041fd299f5d8b4786.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/581330cb236f8f8041fd299f5d8b4786.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge three Fulus using the evolution machine. Unlock stronger abilities, higher essence yields, and brand-new tactical combat options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/228305aa366e24ea6ecd9e0b9c3c3fa0.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/228305aa366e24ea6ecd9e0b9c3c3fa0.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/228305aa366e24ea6ecd9e0b9c3c3fa0.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep mischievous Fulus out of trouble, watch over them when they get naughty, and ensure your lab is always a happy, healthy environment for your creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/89e8b45d320f3ce65aa78b586e85f5d5.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/89e8b45d320f3ce65aa78b586e85f5d5.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/89e8b45d320f3ce65aa78b586e85f5d5.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How lucky are you? Spin the lucky lever and win surprises to power up your Fulus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/5291d562f8f328a5629a4db1571abc4a.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/5291d562f8f328a5629a4db1571abc4a.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/5291d562f8f328a5629a4db1571abc4a.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain special eggs from ancient ambers. Melt the ambers and reveal the eggs hidden within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/939e730ca029e09de664178af2174c4d.poster.avif?t=1774821803\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/939e730ca029e09de664178af2174c4d.webm?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/extras/939e730ca029e09de664178af2174c4d.mp4?t=1774821803\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fulus exhausted from battle regenerate in habitats matching their elements. Keep them happy by placing them in the correct elemental zones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monster Lab Simulator</strong> combines the thrill of synthesis and combat with the joy of collecting and the magic of discovering the unknown\u2014all within your very own monster laboratory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Other Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 Unique Fulu Families</strong> \u2013 Discover 20 different Fulu lineages in your lab!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abilities &amp; Elements</strong> \u2013 80 distinct abilities tailored to specific Fulu families and elements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Order Management</strong> \u2013 Monitor the order screen and boost your economy by meeting market demands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Areas to Explore</strong> \u2013 Level up to unlock deep sections of the laboratory. Upgrade your facility, enhance machinery, and maintain hygiene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assistant Trash Robot</strong> \u2013 End the lab clutter; add the stylish and hardworking trash robot to your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daily &amp; Weekly Missions</strong> \u2013 New laboratory tasks await you every single day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Finally; A Pair of Eyes\u2026</strong> \u2013 Beware of the eyes that are constantly watching you in the lab.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Round 3 Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3994610/10c603d14c6a69f5198db15c872194ac38a99f11/header.jpg?t=1774821803","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</stron